# Pattern Recognition in AI

AI doesn't read a prompt the way a person does. It's matching your words against patterns it's seen across huge numbers of real websites, then predicting what a page like that usually looks like. Below, try it yourself: generate a page from a prompt, then walk through what actually happened behind the scenes.

